❄️ Snowflake Data Engineering Portfolio

## 👋 About Me

ETL and Data Integration professional with 5 years of experience, including DataStage production support and ETL development. Currently expanding my expertise into modern cloud data engineering with Snowflake and AWS.

This repository contains hands-on Snowflake projects demonstrating practical experience with data ingestion, transformation, automation, and data warehouse concepts.

